# Local development environment for the workshop app.
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit the filled-in file.
#
# The Firebase web config lives in firebase-applet-config.json, not here —
# those values are public client identifiers, and access is controlled by
# Firestore rules and the auth checks in the callables.
#
# Cloud Functions secrets (OPENWA_API_KEY, OPENWA_URL, AZURE_*) are NOT set
# here. They live in Secret Manager:
#   firebase functions:secrets:set OPENWA_API_KEY
# See README.md → Setup → Secrets.

# Point the app at local emulators instead of the live project.
# VITE_USE_EMULATORS="true"
